            "heading": "It started with a bike cart on the Brooklyn Bridge.",
            "body": "<p>In the early 2010s, Luke McKenna and Yair Tygiel built a bicycle-powered coconut cart and started throwing tropical parties in the streets of New York. Crack open a coconut in the middle of the city and people stop, smile and start talking.</p>",
