            "kicker": "CoCo & Co",
            "heading": "Coconuts make people happy.",
            "body": "<p>Those street parties grew into CoCo & Co, making custom coconuts for brands and events. The mission was simple then and it still is now: <strong>spread joy with coconuts.</strong></p>",
